{"id":"G0281","lemma":"ἀμήν","transliteration":"amēn","sayIt":"amēn","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"amen","meaning":"ἀμήν, indecl. (Heb. אָמֵן, verbal adj. fr. אמן, to prop. ni., be firm),\n[in LXX: 1Ch.16:36, I Est.9:46, Neh.5:13 8:6, Tob.8:8 14:15, 3Ma.7:23, 4Ma.18:24 (elsewhere ''א is rendered ἀληθινός, Isa.65:16; ἀληθῶς, Je 35 (28):6; γένοιτο, Num.5:22, Deu.27:15ff., 3Ki.1:36, Psa.40 (41):13 71 (72):19 105 (106):48, Jer.11:5)*.]\n1. As adj. (cf. Is, l.with), ὁ ἀ., Rev.3:14.\n2. As adv.,\n(a) in solemn assent to the statements or prayers of another (Nu, Ne, etc., ll. with): ὁ ἀ., 1Co.14:16;\n(b) similarly, at the end of one's own prayer or ascription of praise: Rom.1:25 15:33, Gal.1:5, 1Ti.1:17;\n(with) in the Gospels, exclusively, introducing solemn statements of our Lord, truly, verily: Mat.5:18, 26 Mrk.3:28 (see Swete, in l.), Luk.4:24, al.; ἀ. ἀ., always in Jhn.1:52 3:3 5:19, al.; τὸ ναί, καὶ . . . τὸ ἀ., 2Co.1:20 (on usage in π., see MM, VGT, see word).\n(AS)","glosses":["truly","amen"],"count":101,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"truly","kjv":"verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-5","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-6","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"truly","kjv":"verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-11","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-13","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"truly","kjv":"verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-16","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"Truly","kjv":"Verily"}},{"chapterId":"mat-17","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"truly","kjv":"veri